/// owner-pool's demote floor. A method target or an unresolvable target (e.g.
/// an illegal same-scope `mod m`+`struct m`, which resolves `Ambiguous` →
/// `None`), or a non-`::` site returns `false` (take the owner-prune —
/// recall-safe; never a real-edge drop).
